1. CC-CEDICT  —  IN THIS BUILD
================================================================================

  Source        CC-CEDICT, the Chinese-English dictionary maintained at MDBG
  Home          https://www.mdbg.net/chinese/dictionary?page=cc-cedict
  Licence       Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
                https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

  CC-CEDICT appears in this repository in TWO distinct ways. CC BY-SA 4.0 is
